{"format":1,"key":"zone:gnomeregan","path":"/lore/zone/gnomeregan","name":"Gnomeregan","kind":"dungeon","label":"Dungeon","zone":{"key":"gnomeregan","name":"Gnomeregan","path":"/lore/zone/gnomeregan"},"levels":"Levels 29-38","description":"In Dun Morogh, Gnomeregan lies ruined and quarantined after a desperate defense against troggs. Once the greatest technological wonder of the gnomish…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:gnomeregan","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["In Dun Morogh, Gnomeregan lies ruined and quarantined after a desperate defense against troggs. Once the greatest technological wonder of the gnomish race, it was their underground capital. Its surviving people live as refugees in nearby Ironforge, while irradiated halls hold mutated troggs, deranged leper gnomes, and rogue mechanical sentries.","Gnomeregan once gathered gnomish invention, competitive craft, and politics beneath Dun Morogh. With help from the nearby dwarves of Ironforge, its people built a vast mechanical complex powered by grinding engines and whirring gears. An intricate ventilation network needed fifteen technicians working around the clock to keep fresh air moving. At Tinkers' Court, gnomes debated and competed as their capital grew into a marvel of industry. During the Second War, they sent the Alliance of Lordaeron siege engines, flying machines, and armaments.","During the Third War, as the Scourge tore through Lordaeron, dwarven excavations at the ancient titan vault of Uldaman awakened primitive troggs beneath Dun Morogh. The creatures burrowed into Gnomeregan's lower foundations, and High Tinker Gelbin Mekkatorque led his forces in a desperate defense. When the city's defenses began to fail, Mekkatorque followed the counsel of his chief advisor, Mekgineer Thermaplugg. He ordered the radioactive waste tanks vented into the lower levels to eradicate the invaders. The toxic gas spread beyond control, and nearly eighty percent of the gnomish population died within days."],"hash":"f447e7","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"7893537089","sec":88},"female-narrator":{"sha":"05b170f67b","sec":95}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Gnomeregan","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Gnomeregan"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/gelbin-mekkatorque","n":"Gelbin Mekkatorque","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/sicco-thermaplugg","n":"Mekgineer Thermaplugg","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/zone/dunmorogh","n":"Dun Morogh","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/ironforge","n":"Ironforge","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/topic/gnome","n":"Gnome","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/topic/trogg","n":"Trogg","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/topic/leper-gnome","n":"Leper gnome","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/tinkers-court","n":"Tinkers' Court","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/brewnall-village","n":"Brewnall Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/chill-breeze-valley","n":"Chill Breeze Valley","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/frostmane-hold","n":"Frostmane Hold","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/ironforge","n":"Ironforge","k":"subzone"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/clean-zone","n":"Clean Zone","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/clockwerk-run","n":"Clockwerk Run","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dormitory","n":"Dormitory","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/engineering-labs","n":"Engineering Labs","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/hall-of-gears","n":"Hall of Gears","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/launch-bay","n":"Launch Bay","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/loading-room","n":"Loading Room","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/tinkers-court","n":"Tinkers' Court","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/train-depot","n":"Train Depot","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/workshop-entrance","n":"Workshop Entrance","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/dark-iron-ambassador","n":"Dark Iron Ambassador","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/electrocutioner-6000","n":"Electrocutioner 6000","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/kernobee","n":"Kernobee","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/sicco-thermaplugg","n":"Mekgineer Th